WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[Waves crash]

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.500
[Seabirds call overhead]

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:16.000
[Surf rolls toward the shore]

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:22.000
[Waves break over the rocks]
[Sea foam drifts away]

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:28.000
[Water ripples in the sunlight]

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:34.000
[A swell rises and falls]

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
[Foam washes across the water]

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:46.000
[Waves continue rolling ashore]